    <statement><p>Let <m>z =  \frac{xy}{3x^{2}+3y^{2}}</m>.  Then:</p>
<tabular>
<row>
<cell><m>\frac{\partial z}{\partial x}</m></cell>
<cell><m>=</m></cell>
<cell><fillin characters="50" name="AnSwEr0001"/></cell>
</row>
<row>
<cell><m>\frac{\partial z}{\partial y}</m></cell>
<cell><m>=</m></cell>
<cell><fillin characters="50" name="AnSwEr0002"/></cell>
</row>
</tabular>
</statement>
    <answer>
      <p>
        <m>\frac{y\mathopen{}\left(3y^{2}-3x^{2}\right)}{\left(3x^{2}+3y^{2}\right)^{2}}</m>
      </p>
    </answer>
    <answer>
